<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<pnml xmlns="http://www.pnml.org/version-2009/grammar/pnml">
  <net id="SEQ-11d" type="http://www.pnml.org/version-2009/grammar/ptnet">
    <name><text>11d One foreign project loan: approvals, signing, use of the loan and repayment</text></name>
    <page id="page1">
      <place id="p1"><name><text>start</text></name><initialMarking><text>1</text></initialMarking></place>
      <place id="p2"><name><text>p2</text></name></place>
      <place id="p3"><name><text>p3</text></name></place>
      <place id="p4"><name><text>p4</text></name></place>
      <place id="p5"><name><text>p5</text></name></place>
      <place id="p6"><name><text>p6</text></name></place>
      <place id="p7"><name><text>p7</text></name></place>
      <place id="p8"><name><text>p8</text></name></place>
      <place id="p9"><name><text>p9</text></name></place>
      <place id="p10"><name><text>p10</text></name></place>
      <place id="p11"><name><text>p11</text></name></place>
      <place id="p12"><name><text>p12</text></name></place>
      <place id="p13"><name><text>p13</text></name></place>
      <place id="p14"><name><text>p14</text></name></place>
      <place id="p15"><name><text>p15</text></name></place>
      <place id="p16"><name><text>p16</text></name></place>
      <place id="p17"><name><text>p17</text></name></place>
      <place id="p18"><name><text>p18</text></name></place>
      <place id="p19"><name><text>p19</text></name></place>
      <place id="p20"><name><text>p20</text></name></place>
      <place id="p21"><name><text>p21</text></name></place>
      <place id="p22"><name><text>p22</text></name></place>
      <place id="p23"><name><text>end</text></name></place>
      <transition id="t01"><name><text>1. National agency to ICC: Project proposal for ICC review</text></name></transition>
      <transition id="t02"><name><text>2. ICC to National agency: ICC recommendation, ED Council approval</text></name></transition>
      <transition id="t03"><name><text>3. National agency to DBM: Request to provide for the project in the budget</text></name></transition>
      <transition id="t04"><name><text>4. DBM to DOF: Forward Obligational Authority (project loan)</text></name></transition>
      <transition id="t05"><name><text>5. DOF to Monetary Board: Request for approval in principle of the loan terms</text></name></transition>
      <transition id="t06"><name><text>6. Monetary Board to DOF: Approval in principle</text></name></transition>
      <transition id="t07"><name><text>7. DOF to Office of the President: Request for Special Authority, at least 10 working days before the date needed, with: agency letter, draft loan agreement, Monetary Board concurrence, statement of compliance with laws, Forward Obligational Authority</text></name></transition>
      <transition id="t08"><name><text>8. Office of the President to DOF: Special Authority (or Full Powers) to negotiate and sign</text></name></transition>
      <transition id="t09"><name><text>9. DOF to Dealers and lenders: Negotiation. Loan documents cleared by the inter-agency committee that reviews foreign loan documents</text></name></transition>
      <transition id="t10"><name><text>10. DOF to Dealers and lenders: Loan agreement signed</text></name></transition>
      <transition id="t11"><name><text>11. Monetary Board to DOF: Final approval of the loan terms</text></name></transition>
      <transition id="t12"><name><text>12. DOJ to DOF: Legal opinion on the authority of the borrower</text></name></transition>
      <transition id="t13"><name><text>13. Dealers and lenders to DOF: Loan declared effective</text></name></transition>
      <transition id="t14"><name><text>14. National agency to Dealers and lenders: Withdrawal application, after the delivery is accepted and the bill is approved. The agency records the asset and a payable</text></name></transition>
      <transition id="t15"><name><text>15. Dealers and lenders: Pays the supplier directly</text></name></transition>
      <transition id="t16"><name><text>16. BTr to National agency: Journal entry voucher of BTr: the lender has paid. BTr records the subsidy to the agency and the loan</text></name></transition>
      <transition id="t17"><name><text>17. National agency to DBM: Copy of that voucher and the list of suppliers paid</text></name></transition>
      <transition id="t18"><name><text>18. DBM to National agency: Non-Cash Availment Authority. The agency closes the payable against Subsidy from National Government</text></name></transition>
      <transition id="tau1"><name><text>end of: Direct payment</text></name></transition>
      <transition id="t19"><name><text>19. Dealers and lenders to BTr: Loan proceeds to the Treasury. BTr records cash and Loans Payable-Foreign on the credit advice of BSP</text></name></transition>
      <transition id="t20"><name><text>20. DBM to National agency: NCA under the MDS sub-account for foreign-assisted projects</text></name></transition>
      <transition id="tau2"><name><text>end of: Cash through the Treasury</text></name></transition>
      <transition id="t21"><name><text>21. BTr to Dealers and lenders: Interest and principal on the due dates, from the Treasury Single Account. Only the books of BTr record them: principal reduces the loan payable, interest is an expense</text></name></transition>
